@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+# Docker镜像构建与推送指南
+
+## 1. docker镜像构建命令
+
+```bash
+docker build -t rasp-cloud:latest .
+```
+
+## 2. 推送镜像到harbor
+
+```bash
+docker tag rasp-cloud:latest 172.18.8.210:5000/library/dba-rasp-cloud:v0917
+docker push 172.18.8.210:5000/library/dba-rasp-cloud:v0917
+```
